label placeDoll
I seat the mannequin on the chair in front of the camera.
Instead of a head, the mannequin has some sort of threaded hole.
[signal arg="Bathroom_DollPlacedOnChair"]
[end_timeline]

label placeHead
I screw the strange cylinder into the mannequin where its head should be.
[signal arg="Bathroom_HeadPlacedOnChair"]
[end_timeline]

label placeClothes
I lay out the clothes next to the mannequin. Now I can dress it...
[signal arg="Bathroom_ClothesPlacedOnChair"]
[end_timeline]
label chairUseWithoutDoll
The chair stands suspiciously in the middle of the bathroom, right in front of the camera.
[end_timeline]
label chairUseWithDoll
The mannequin sits suspiciously in the middle of the bathroom, right in front of the camera.
[end_timeline]
label chairUseWithPuzzle
# res://scenes/puzzles/bathroom/BathroomDollDressing.tscn
do PuzzleStates.startPuzzle("uid://by6ly44g2wjrv")
[end_timeline]